"μήν-υ—μα, ατος, τό, information laid, Th. 6.61 , PSI 6.684.19 (iv/v A. D.): in pl., Th. 6.29 , Men. Epit. 206 . indication, χρόνου Aenesid. ap. S.E. M. 10.217 , cf. Clearch. 45 (pl.), D.H. 1.59 (pl.), Ph. 2.304 (pl.), Hierocl. in CA 1p.419M. θεῶν μηνύματα evocations, Orph. H. 86.16 , cf. Man. 4.556 . αἰπολικὸν μήνυμα a site pointed out by goatherds, AP 9.101 ( Alph. )."